### Digital UP Board API - local requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
### Fill in sessionId / ids from GET /api/board. Use new UUIDs for new intents only.

@api = http://localhost:3000
@token = local-dev-token
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@assignmentId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@visitId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@participantId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Board
GET {{api}}/api/board
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manual arrival
POST {{api}}/api/arrivals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "eventId": "{{$guid}}",
  "source": "Manual",
  "detectedAt": null,
  "attributes": {
    "upperDescription": "Red coat",
    "lowerDescription": "Jeans",
    "accessoryDescription": null,
    "ageGroup": "From20To39",
    "gender": "Unknown"
  }
}

### Availability
POST {{api}}/api/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}", "participantId": "{{participantId}}", "commandId": "{{$guid}}", "state": "OffFloor" }

### Accept
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}" }

### Outcome
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/outcome
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}", "outcome": "Sale" }

### Profile correction
PATCH {{api}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "source": "Manual",
  "enrichmentStatus": "NotRequested",
  "attributes": {
    "upperDescription": "Green coat",
    "lowerDescription": "Jeans",
    "accessoryDescription": "Backpack",
    "ageGroup": "Age60Plus",
    "gender": "Female"
  }
}

### Departure (outcome optional when already recorded)
POST {{api}}/api/visits/{{visitId}}/departure
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}", "outcome": "NoSale" }

### Reset demo
POST {{api}}/api/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}" }
